    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27578" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῑφ-άω</span></b> , only pres., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>search after,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόντῳ ἐν ἰχθυόεντι . . τήθεα διφῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.747
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεὴν διφῶσα καλιήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					374
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν οὔρεσι πάντα λαγωὸν διφᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Epigr.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				165
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διφᾶν τὰ καλύμματα</span> (or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλύσματα,</span> q. v.)
			<i>search</i> them <i>well,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				10.6
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				6.73
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ ποθι διφώωσα . . ἀθρήσειεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					48.592
				</span></i>
			:—
				Ion.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διφέω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.559
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>).</div>
